{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Commensurable magnitudes have to one another the ratio which a number has to a number.","book":10,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","contentId":"euclid-10-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2300f49b8aa9e7c1aaaa75ff6659737ba119f30674bafce0b9e34b64ae7900a8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-5.statement","euclid-10-5.construction.1","euclid-10-5.proof.1","euclid-10-5.construction.2","euclid-10-5.proof.2","euclid-10-5.proof.3","euclid-10-5.proof.4","euclid-10-5.proof.5","euclid-10-5.conclusion","euclid-10-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d2a3a53dc06ed84d5dbfbfe5609c3ec5545a7d5b3db199c8b09a24054e69dc2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Commensurable magnitudes have to one another the ratio which a number has to a number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可公度级的数值必须相互对应, 数字必须和数字的比例是相同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e52a2c76c6ea2db32d4c496dfc284505dd0aa6492eacfb00679a1924e26c77cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be commensurable magnitudes; I say that A has to B the ratio which a number has to a number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是可公度级;我说,A比B,一个数字等于一个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aeef9893b9617fffab55f6f4c32610c96125a047aac8dfebcd71f7a0437da994","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B are commensurable, some magnitude will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,A,B是可公度, 一定的量度它们。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10d6ff7eacdbc97fcecaaacf858a92b89cd4b7ecae43a7de6a436187c7b6e148","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure them, and let it be C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它测量它们,让它达到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8195097d5b6079f84106a160ade466ca88a5fff62bccfb97cd0dc3e25cac50f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as C measures A, so many units let there be in D; and, as many times as C measures B, so many units let there be in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C单位A,D单位C;C单位B单位E单位E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b84c923386e453671089b8c145622ee3e288355d7b458715d95fb4a3a4f731c4","citations":["euclid-7-def-20","euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then C measures A according to the units in D, while the unit also measures D according to the units in it, therefore the unit measures the number D the same number of times as the magnitude C measures A; therefore, as C is to A, so is the unit to D; [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] therefore, inversely, as A is to C, so is D to the unit. [cf. [V. 7, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 C 度量 A 的次数等于 D 所包含的单位数，而单位 1 度量 D 的次数同样等于 D 所包含的单位数，所以 C 与 A 之比等于单位 1 与 D 之比；反过来，A 与 C 之比等于 D 与单位 1 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] [V. 7, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-7)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a80de9d73cc2d842e780476b80c91c3480a0caf35be91e21e95719088d0d26ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since C measures B according to the units in E, while the unit also measures E according to the units in it, therefore the unit measures E the same number of times as C measures B; therefore, as C is to B, so is the unit to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E单位C项措施B项措施以来,该单位也根据其中各单位E项措施,因此,该单位E项措施是C项措施B项措施的相同倍数;因此,C项与B项措施的比等于该单位E项措施的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b272ae2b0dc92fe8cee5bc6358d8ecf03a945a97a046f658e2276e455d59c77","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as A is to C, so is D to the unit; therefore, ex aequali, as A is to B, so is the number D to E. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,A对C的比等于D对单位的比;因此,从平等角度看,A对B的比等于D对E的比 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf38c058b6acc4c5faad53061f5b620b8184ee34081e8d97403351fcc4c16d1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the commensurable magnitudes A, B have to one another the ratio which the number D has to the number E. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,可公度级的A,B, 彼此之间必须达到D和E的比。 Q. D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-5.source","contentId":"euclid-10-5","revisionId":"euclid-10-5@raw-2300f49b8aa9e7c1","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca4a1301c02be4c49962bf33a28216f7fc45c82fdac7607e72ef8f38966b9b4a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-5:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-5.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-5:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-5.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5/","sourceLabel":"V. 7, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-5:euclid-5-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-5.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.5/","sourceLabel":"V. 22"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-8:euclid-10-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-8.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.8